73,96,21],[25412,42.4,1980,73,90,22],[25709,41.7,1963,71,92,19]],"links":[["Centre County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/pennsylvania/centre-county"],["ARC or PLC in Centre County","/arc-plc/pennsylvania/centre-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 16 grids in Centre County came in under 90% of normal in August to September and in September to October in 34 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025, August to September came in at 53% of normal on the middle of the grids, and November to December in 2025 at 66%. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, with grid 24808 at 70% of normal that year.</p>"}
